@title Wire numbering conflicts: a triangle in front of each row, the sentence in its popup
@area Schematic
# T8: the Conflicts tab of Edit > Wires > Wire numbering. No glyph characters, no sentence on the row: a yellow triangle (red for an error) and the kind; click the triangle for the detail.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Conflicts Button
wait 8
expect "Warning: No number"
expect_not "no number:"
shot conflict-triangles
check_layout
